{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Do not be agitated:</b> Do not conspire against me to say, 'Our brother is great in the land,' to do wrong to anyone. Rather: do not be agitated against anyone to travel on the road through a sown field. Another interpretation: He said to them: Do not engage in matters of halakhah." "<b>אליהם אל תרגזו</b> — in gematria this is: אל תדברו בהלכה (do not speak of halakhah)." "<b>אלהם אל תרגזו בדרך</b> — in gematria this is: אל תפסעו פסיעה גסה (do not take a wide step)."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:27.123126839Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}